    <!-- Stacked layers: replaces Glyph.Redo's mistaken reuse on Kamil's "Průchody" (passes) tile
         (icon audit, 2026-09-09) — an undo/redo arrow does not communicate a repeat count. Deliberately
         the same three-band-stack visual language as the old (superseded, unused) Glyph.Materials
         geometry — "repeated layers" is the correct universal metaphor for "passes" too — but drawn
         narrower/fresh rather than reusing that key's exact coordinates, since Materials-the-concept
         is still very much alive via Glyph.Fill.Materials elsewhere in the app. -->
